<center><table border="0" width="90%" bgcolor="#131F3D" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td><b><font color="#FF0000" size="3">July 29 2002 Ssraeshza Temple.</font></b></td></tr><tr><td width="100%" height="1" bgcolor="#FF8040"></td></tr><tr><td><font size="1" color="#999999"><i>Posted by <a href="mailto:yumarie@divinewinds.org">yumarie</a></i> on Tuesday, 30 July 2002 7:57 PM JST</font></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class="BODYTEXT"><font color="#EEEEEE"><a href="http://eqbeastiary.allakhazam.com/search.shtml?id=7828" target="_blank">Rhag`Zhezum</a><br><br><img src="http://divinewinds.org/images/RhagZhezum01.jpg" alt="Rhag`Zhezum"><br><br>Bone Golem Vambraces > Anson<br>Scale Mesh Vambraces > Sinatiku<br>A Glowing Orb of Luclinite > Hihiee<br><br>Nature's Recovery, Brell's Mountainous Barrier, Blessing of Aegolism > Guild bank<br><br><br><a href="http://eqbeastiary.allakhazam.com/search.shtml?id=7829" target="_blank">Rhag`Mozdezh</a><br><br><img src="http://divinewinds.org/images/RhagMozdezh01.jpg" alt="Rhag`Mozdezh"><br><br>Bone Golem Greaves > Eason<br>Crystal Interpetation > Loherangrin<br>A Glowing Orb of Luclinite > Punches<br><br>Funeral Pyre of Kelador, Maelstrom of Electricity, Cloak of the Akheva > Guild bank</font></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr></table></center>
<a name="newsitem1027936876,55975,"></a>
<center><table border="0" width="90%" bgcolor="#131F3D" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td><b><font color="#FF0000" size="3">We had fun.</font></b></td></tr><tr><td width="100%" height="1" bgcolor="#FF8040"></td></tr><tr><td><font size="1" color="#999999"><i>Posted by <a href="mailto:yumarie@divinewinds.org">yumarie</a></i> on Monday, 29 July 2002 8:01 PM JST</font></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class="BODYTEXT"><font color="#EEEEEE">We did raid together with Forces and Ravens Nest.<br><br>Lord Yelinak<br><br><img src="http://divinewinds.org/images/LordYelinak01.jpg" alt="Lord Yelinak"><br><br>Klandicar<br><br><a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=5551" target="_blank">Klandicar's Talisman</a> > Qualan<br><br><img src="http://divinewinds.org/images/Klandicar02.jpg" alt="Klandicar"><br></font></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr></table></center>
<a name="newsitem1027846943,52953,"></a>
<center><table border="0" width="90%" bgcolor="#131F3D" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td><b><font color="#FF0000" size="3">GM event is Qeynos Hills.(!?)</font></b></td></tr><tr><td width="100%" height="1" bgcolor="#FF8040"></td></tr><tr><td><font size="1" color="#999999"><i>Posted by <a href="mailto:yumarie@divinewinds.org">yumarie</a></i> on Sunday, 28 July 2002 7:02 PM JST</font></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class="BODYTEXT"><font color="#EEEEEE">Sun Jul 28 15:34 2002 at JST.<br><br>A Glacial current of wind, seemingly consumed with anger and hatred, devours the land. Commontion from the Hills of Qeynos becomes evident as barking and howling begins in a low murmur, escalating into a chorus of war. What will become of the serenity that is Qeynos Hills, and its neightboring village of Surefall Glade? Will once quiet lands be swarming with Gnolls? What could they be up to?</font></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr></table></center>
<a name="newsitem1027828752,95571,"></a>
<center><table border="0" width="90%" bgcolor="#131F3D" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td><b><font color="#FF0000" size="3">GM event in swamp of no hope</font></b></td></tr><tr><td width="100%" height="1" bgcolor="#FF8040"></td></tr><tr><td><font size="1" color="#999999"><i>Posted by <a href="mailto:yumarie@divinewinds.org">yumarie</a></i> on Sunday, 28 July 2002 1:59 PM JST</font></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class="BODYTEXT"><font color="#EEEEEE">Sun Jul 28 11:47 2002 at JST.<br><br>You feel a chill travel up your spine and the hair on the back of your neck stands on end as an ancient evil passes through and beyone you, carried by a clammy, decrepit breeze.  "Ith-eee-oh-sar.." it whispers in a hollow voice tainted with vengeance.  A foul and wretched mist settles over the swamp of no hope, as an ancient and vile evil is embodied there.<br><br><img src="http://divinewinds.org/images/IthiosartheFallen02.jpg" alt="Ithiosar the Fallen"><br><br>There are 101 players in Swamp of No Hope.<br>We killed Ithiosar the Fallen. But Ithiosar the Black poped. We lost.<br>(Sun Jul 28 14:53 2002 at JST)<br><br><img src="http://divinewinds.org/images/IthiosartheBlack01.jpg" alt="Ithiosar the Black"><br><br>Random 1000 winer Kossori! Congratulations.<br><a href="http://divinewinds.org/images/ShadowFuryGirdle.jpg" target="_blank">Shadow Fury Girdle</a></font></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr></table></center>
<a name="newsitem1027421768,5627,"></a>
<center><table border="0" width="90%" bgcolor="#131F3D" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td><b><font color="#FF0000" size="3">July 22 2002 loot items</font></b></td></tr><tr><td width="100%" height="1" bgcolor="#FF8040"></td></tr><tr><td><font size="1" color="#999999"><i>Posted by <a href="mailto:yumarie@divinewinds.org">yumarie</a></i> on Tuesday, 23 July 2002 8:56 PM JST</font></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class="BODYTEXT"><font color="#EEEEEE">Venril Sathir in Karnor's Castle.<br><br><a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=3582">Ancient Shissar Gauntlet</a> > Claes<br><a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=2687">Gnarled Staff</a> > Ibenla<br><a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=11398">Blackened Iksar Bones</a> > Punches<br><a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=1361">Jaundiced Bone Greaves</a> > Guild bank<br><br>Trakanon in Old Sebilis.<br><br><a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=587">Trakanon's Tooth</a> > Guild bank<br><a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=2060">Blood Ember Breastplate</a> > Guild bank<br><a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=2056">Jaundiced Bone Breastplate</a> > Guild bank<br><a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=8506">Spell: Dictate</a> > Guild bank<br><br>Tolapumj in Old Sebilis.<br><br><a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=2114">Tolapumj's Robe</a> > Kater<br>Spell: Malo > Guild bank<br>Spell: Wind of Tishanian > Guild bank<br><br><img src="http://divinewinds.org/images/Trakanon02.jpg" alt="Trakanon"></font></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr></table></center>
